    // Generate JWT token
    const token = generateToken(user);

    res.json({ token });
  } catch (error) {
    next(error);
  }
});
```

## Conclusion

This application needs immediate attention to authentication and authorization before being deployed to production. Once these critical gaps are addressed, the application follows many security best practices for an Express.js application.

